1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,460
Don't start vibe coding with Claude code unless you've

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,600
installed these five tools.

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:04,920
The first is REA.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,660
It lets Claude open any app, website, or APK and trace every

5
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,900
feature down to the code, so the moment you wonder how

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,260
something works, it shows you the proof, and you never have

7
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:13,680
to guess.

8
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,480
The second is Agent Reach.

9
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:19,100
It lets Claude read Reddit, X, YouTube, and GitHub with zero

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,360
API fees, which shows you exactly what users hate before you

11
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,580
write a line, install it, and build what they want.

12
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,780
The third is Replica.

13
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:29,420
It gives Claude 11 skills that scan the app, plan it, build

14
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:32,000
it, and test it, so you never start from a blank page.

15
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,460
One app, start to finish.

16
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:37,560
The fourth is Context 7, from Upstash, with over 60 ,000

17
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:37,900
stars.

18
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:41,600
It pulls the current docs for any library you use, so Claude

19
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,660
stops writing code that broke two versions ago.

20
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:45,080
Fresh docs, every time.

21
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:48,260
And the fifth is Chrome DevTools MCP, from the Chrome team

22
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:48,680
at Google.

23
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,680
It lets Claude open your app in a real browser, so it sees

24
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,440
the red errors and fixes them itself.

25
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:56,880
It tests itself, comment tools, and I'll send you one link

26
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,540
with all five.
